3. Representations. The Seller represents and warrants that:
(a) The Seller has good and valid title to the Shares, free and clear of all liens and encumbrances;
(b) The financial statements previously provided are true, complete, and accurate in all material respects;
(c) The Seller is in compliance in all material respects with all applicable laws;
(d) Since the date of the last audited financial statements, there has been no material adverse change in the business, operations, or financial condition of the Company.
